usage: spdz_inference.py [-h] [--workload {matmul,square_mlp}] [--m M [M ...]]
                         [--k K [K ...]] [--n N] [--hidden HIDDEN]
                         [--device DEVICE]
                         [--backend {host,device,compressed,device-deferred}]
                         [--mac-keys MAC_KEYS] [--repeats REPEATS]
                         [--unstacked-macs] [--prepare-model]
                         [--output-check-threshold OUTPUT_CHECK_THRESHOLD]
                         [--replay-warmups REPLAY_WARMUPS]
                         [--profile-path PROFILE_PATH] [--stream-incoming]
                         [--output OUTPUT]

Measure per-party authenticated field inference with isolated replay. The
initial preprocessing provider is an explicit trusted dealer. Its generation
and owner-private input sharing are reported separately from resident online
inference. Replay uses only a fixed fixture and must never handle live inputs.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --workload {matmul,square_mlp}
  --m M [M ...]
  --k K [K ...]
  --n N
  --hidden HIDDEN
  --device DEVICE
  --backend {host,device,compressed,device-deferred}
  --mac-keys MAC_KEYS
  --repeats REPEATS
  --unstacked-macs
  --prepare-model
  --output-check-threshold OUTPUT_CHECK_THRESHOLD
                        deferred final-output full-vector limit;0forces
                        compressed
  --replay-warmups REPLAY_WARMUPS
  --profile-path PROFILE_PATH
                        cProfile one discarded isolated warmup; timed samples
                        stay unprofiled
  --stream-incoming     load one ideal GPU incoming fixture at each untimed
                        transport boundary
  --output OUTPUT
